        // but in the checker setup msg.sender for calls on c will be this contract (InvMutTest),
        // so owner of c is payable(address_of_checker). We cannot know it here. However we can
        // observe behavior by attempting calls both as this contract (non-owner) and by having C
        // perform owner-only actions via sending calls that simulate owner via sendMoney etc. }

